          "text": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ca18ede8a5b1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f92f1bd6c8cc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "1. Is Australia good for Nepali students?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0d4bbbb80bbc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5fe2a899a9da",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, Australia offers quality education, work rights, post-study visas, and PR opportunities, making it ideal for Nepali students."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6851f860090a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2b80d716d030",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "2. What are the requirements to study in Australia from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4ab0a25d0412",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7040e3729b67",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You need academic qualifications, English proficiency ("
        },
        {
          "_key": "81b215b4d91a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5098e48ad784"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f84a1cd0d7ae",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "/PTE), financial proof, a CoE, and a student visa."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5098e48ad784",
          "_type": "link",
          "blank": false,
          "href": "https://admizzeducation.com/study-in-australia-without-ielts/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0e0cb4f915ec",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bed0bb1169f0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "3. How much does it cost to study in Australia from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d77a8266e676",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c4686b9d4586",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The total cost ranges from AUD 35,000 to 55,000 per year, including tuition and living expenses."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1607f422001c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2e2aff8d2b33",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "4. Can Nepali students work while studying in Australia?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e8cc4802d1b7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "67cb92a69614",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, students can work 48 hours per fortnight during study and unlimited hours during holidays."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "45608b6f67ea",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d6f6113e6bf0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "5. Are scholarships available for Nepali students?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4e58c76d62b1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e04f76bb1ec9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, Australian universities and the government offer multiple scholarships for eligible Nepali students."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fb93f4eb357c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "97283b405fa4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "6. What is the post-study work visa duration?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "62d8beb18225",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2167ea94e5e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Depending on your qualification, you can stay and work in Australia for 2 to 6 years after graduation."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "882eda879ea5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "86062a350a95",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "7. Can studying in Australia lead to PR?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "753d98d64074",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "030a11809461",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, many Nepali students successfully transition from study visas to PR through skilled migration pathways."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "36bb9113a376",
